{
  "description": "What a type gets for the physics its pack leaves out (stock.StockDefaults): the running resistance of a mass and the brakes of a system for a mass with a cab or without (input mass_t, system, drivable; expected {resistance {a, b, c, c_front}, brakes {train_kn, independent_kn, dynamic_kn, dynamic_fade_kmh, parking_kn, apply_s, release_s}}), a brake system by its name (input system_name; expected its name or null), the constants (input constants; expected {adhesion, traction_ramp_s, default_brake_system, systems}).",
